        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MS211, Mail Slot Door and Interior Trim Bezel</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComplete packaged solid brass mail slot door. Package includes exterior mail door, interior trim bezel for mail slot opening and installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-MS211-size.gif?v=1704354549\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MS211 Mail Slot Door Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana MS211 Mail Slot:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Hole Centers: 12-1/16\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Hole Centers: 2-9/16\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Interior Opening Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Opening  Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Mail Door Opening: 45 degrees</li>\r\n<li>Spring Loaded Exterior Flap</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MS211.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MS211 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the mail slot door will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYou can add a <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-letter-box-sleeve-deltana-mss005\"><b>MSS005 Stainless Steel Letter Box Sleeve</b></a> if needed from the drop down menu below. The sleeves are typically used on 1-3/4\" thick commercial hollow metal doors.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Mail Slot with Trim Bezel | Deltana MS211",
                "description": "Deltana MS211 - Brass mail slot with inside trim bezel. 11 inches long by 2 1/4 inches high.  Complete packaged solid brass mail slot door. Package includes exterior mail door, interior trim bezel for mail slot opening and installation screws. Available in 9 different finishes.",
                "keywords": "DEL-MS211 Brass Mail Slots with Trim Bezel, Deltana MS211 Brass mail slots, door mail opening, mail doors, mail slot for doors,  mailslots, door mail slots, door slots, letter slots, mailboxes, letter boxes, DEL-MS211U10B, DEL-MS211U15, DEL-MS211U15A, DEL-MS211U19, DEL-MS211U26, DEL-MS211U26D, DEL-MS211U3, DEL-MS211U5, DEL-MS211CR003"
